{"meta":{"ui":"data_table","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Show the twelve invoices you found as a table: number, customer, date, amount and status. I can sort by any column, filter by status, type to search the customer, page through five at a time, tick rows (and a tick-all for the page), and a bar appears with the count and total of what I ticked and a button to send reminders for them.","text":"Twelve invoices and a full table with sort, filter, search, paging, selection and a bar: I'll build the data, the state, and the table with a derived page.\n\nstate invoices=[{\"id\":\"INV-1041\",\"customer\":\"Northwind Traders\",\"date\":\"2024-03-02\",\"amount\":1840,\"status\":\"Paid\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1042\",\"customer\":\"Blue Harbor Cafe\",\"date\":\"2024-03-04\",\"amount\":412,\"status\":\"Overdue\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1043\",\"customer\":\"Atlas Freight\",\"date\":\"2024-03-05\",\"amount\":2960,\"status\":\"Due\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1044\",\"customer\":\"Maple & Pine\",\"date\":\"2024-03-07\",\"amount\":128,\"status\":\"Paid\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1045\",\"customer\":\"Northwind Traders\",\"date\":\"2024-03-09\",\"amount\":755,\"status\":\"Due\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1046\",\"customer\":\"Corvid Labs\",\"date\":\"2024-03-11\",\"amount\":5200,\"status\":\"Overdue\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1047\",\"customer\":\"Lark Studio\",\"date\":\"2024-03-12\",\"amount\":610,\"status\":\"Paid\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1048\",\"customer\":\"Blue Harbor Cafe\",\"date\":\"2024-03-14\",\"amount\":289,\"status\":\"Due\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1049\",\"customer\":\"Atlas Freight\",\"date\":\"2024-03-16\",\"amount\":1375,\"status\":\"Paid\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1050\",\"customer\":\"Fenwick Dental\",\"date\":\"2024-03-18\",\"amount\":940,\"status\":\"Overdue\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1051\",\"customer\":\"Corvid Labs\",\"date\":\"2024-03-20\",\"amount\":3380,\"status\":\"Due\"},{\"id\":\"INV-1052\",\"customer\":\"Lark Studio\",\"date\":\"2024-03-22\",\"amount\":220,\"status\":\"Paid\"}]\nstate ticked=[]\nstate sort=\"date\"\nstate desc=false\nstate filter=\"All\"\nstate query=\"\"\nstate page=0\nstate rowsAll=filter(invoices,r=>(filter==\"All\"||r.status==filter)&&(query==\"\"||contains(lower(r.customer),lower(query))))\nstate rows=sortBy(rowsAll,r=>r.date)\nCard pad:16 gap:12\n  Text.sectionTitle \"Invoices\"\n  Input \"Search customer\" =query\n  SegmentedButton =filter items:[\"All\",\"Paid\",\"Due\",\"Overdue\"]\n  Row gap:8\n    Text.caption \"Sort by\"\n    Select =sort items:[\"date\",\"customer\",\"amount\",\"status\"]\n    Toggle \"Desc\" =desc\n  Grid cols:5 gap:4\n    Text.fieldLabel \"No.\"\n    Text.fieldLabel \"Customer\"\n    Text.fieldLabel \"Date\"\n    Text.fieldLabel \"Amount\"\n    Text.fieldLabel \"Status\"\n  Column gap:6\n    each row in slice(rows,page*5,page*5+5)\n      Row gap:8\n        Checkbox =ticked\n        Text.body \"{row.id}\"\n        Text.body \"{row.customer}\"\n        Text.body \"{row.amount}\"\n        Badge.neutral \"{row.status}\"\n  Row between\n    Text.caption \"Page {page+1} of {max(1,ceil(length(rows)/5))}\"\n    Row gap:8\n      Button.outline \"Prev\" -> page=max(0,page-1)\n      Button.outline \"Next\" -> page=min(ceil(length(rows)/5)-1,page+1)\n  if length(ticked)>0\n    Card fill:#FF1F2937 pad:12\n      Row between\n        Text.strong \"{length(ticked)} selected, {money(sum(filter(invoices,r=>contains(ticked,r.id)),r=>r.amount),\"$\",0)}\"\n        Button \"Send reminders\" -> emit remind ticked","usage":{"input_tokens":7830,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1299,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":566,"totalMs":5460}}
